 "prompts": [
  "Medical capital trade-ins: when a hospital trades in an imaging system, monitor, pump or ventilator, record the regulatory assessment of the planned work, then refurbish and resell, resell as is, harvest parts or recycle. Single-use devices are recycled; a device with patient data is sanitised before it leaves; a sale in another market needs the UDI, the service record and closed recalls.",
  "Assess the planned work before refurbishing",
  "Sanitise patient data before any release"
 ],
 "clarify": null,
